1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"A System for Looking"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"August 5, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"3 minutes"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-Before I make anything, I look.",{"children":"Before I make anything, I look."}],["$","p","1-This sounds obvious. It took me a while to understand what I meant by it.",{"children":"This sounds obvious. It took me a while to understand what I meant by it."}],["$","p","2-I used to confuse looking with collecting. I would open a browser, save fifty images, and call the result research. The collection grew. My understanding did not.",{"children":"I used to confuse looking with collecting. I would open a browser, save fifty images, and call the result research. The collection grew. My understanding did not."}],["$","p","3-Now I try to begin with a question.",{"children":"Now I try to begin with a question."}],["$","p","4-What am I actually trying to understand? What has become so familiar that no one sees it anymore? What does a person need to know, feel, or do—and in what order?",{"children":"What am I actually trying to understand? What has become so familiar that no one sees it anymore? What does a person need to know, feel, or do—and in what order?"}],["$","p","5-The question does not need to point toward an answer. It only needs to give the looking a shape.",{"children":"The question does not need to point toward an answer. It only needs to give the looking a shape."}],["$","p","6-I start near the subject. If I am working on an annual report, I look at annual reports. I need to understand the form before I decide what to do with it.",{"children":"I start near the subject. If I am working on an annual report, I look at annual reports. I need to understand the form before I decide what to do with it."}],["$","p","7-Then I move farther away.",{"children":"Then I move farther away."}],["$","p","8-I might look at newspapers, maps, instruction manuals, or paintings. A newspaper knows how to handle density. A map knows how to hold several scales at once. A painting may know something useful about directing the eye.",{"children":"I might look at newspapers, maps, instruction manuals, or paintings. A newspaper knows how to handle density. A map knows how to hold several scales at once. A painting may know something useful about directing the eye."}],["$","p","9-I am not looking for a style to borrow. I am trying to notice what something is doing.",{"children":"I am not looking for a style to borrow. I am trying to notice what something is doing."}],["$","p","10-When I save a reference, I write down why. The scale makes the ordinary feel important. The repetition creates trust. The awkward pause makes me pay attention.",{"children":"When I save a reference, I write down why. The scale makes the ordinary feel important. The repetition creates trust. The awkward pause makes me pay attention."}],["$","p","11-That sentence is usually more useful than the image. It gives me enough distance to carry the idea somewhere else without copying its appearance.",{"children":"That sentence is usually more useful than the image. It gives me enough distance to carry the idea somewhere else without copying its appearance."}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10"],null]}],"$L11"]}]]}]}]
b:["$","p","12-Then I arrange what I have found and start removing things.",{"children":"Then I arrange what I have found and start removing things."}]
c:["$","p","13-One reference tells me what I like. Several references placed together begin to tell me what I think. The one that does not fit is often worth keeping around. It may be pointing to something the rest of the collection has politely avoided.",{"children":"One reference tells me what I like. Several references placed together begin to tell me what I think. The one that does not fit is often worth keeping around. It may be pointing to something the rest of the collection has politely avoided."}]
d:["$","p","14-Time helps too. I am easily persuaded by novelty and finish. If I leave the references alone for a day, some become less convincing. A few become more interesting.",{"children":"Time helps too. I am easily persuaded by novelty and finish. If I leave the references alone for a day, some become less convincing. A few become more interesting."}]
e:["$","p","15-Eventually I make something, usually before I feel ready. A rough sketch shows whether an observation can survive contact with actual words, scale, and use. Often it cannot. Then I know where to look next.",{"children":"Eventually I make something, usually before I feel ready. A rough sketch shows whether an observation can survive contact with actual words, scale, and use. Often it cannot. Then I know where to look next."}]
f:["$","p","16-So the system is not very complicated: begin with a question, look outside the category, name what matters, arrange, remove, make, and look again.",{"children":"So the system is not very complicated: begin with a question, look outside the category, name what matters, arrange, remove, make, and look again."}]
10:["$","p","17-The point is not to build an impressive moodboard. It is to notice enough that a decision becomes easier.",{"children":"The point is not to build an impressive moodboard. It is to notice enough that a decision becomes easier."}]
11:["$","footer",null,{"className":"footer","children":[["$","$La",null,{"className":"footer-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"footer-links","aria-label":"Site","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:hello@thinking.haus","children":"About"}],["$","$La",null,{"href":"/","aria-current":"page","children":"Lists"}]]}]]}]
